<title>UK: BALTIC FREIGHT INDEX UNCHANGED AT 1,281.</title>
<headline>BALTIC FREIGHT INDEX UNCHANGED AT 1,281.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates was unchanged today from 1,281 on Aug 11, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
